OL,3,GNEWSA'You do feel like a pop star' -
OL,4,AStephen Bunting on his viral walk-on
OL,5,
OL,6,FStephen "The Bullet" Bunting's love for
OL,7,Fdarts was formed at a young age while
OL,8,Fwatching his dad play at their local
OL,9,Fpub.
OL,11,F"I think I was about 12 or 13," he
OL,12,Fremembered. "Hood up, sneaking around,
OL,13,Fsitting at the back, being very quiet
OL,14,Fwith a bag of crisps and a fizzy
OL,15,Forange."
OL,17,FNearly three decades later, and now a
OL,18,Ffather himself, everything has gone
OL,19,Ffull circle for Fazakerley's finest.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
